{
  "dom_id": "step-12058",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Identifying the Graph of a Stretched Tangent Function",
  "problem": "Given that $f(x) = \\tan \\left( \\dfrac{x}{4} \\right),$ what is the graph of the curve $y=f(x)?$",
  "worked_solution": "In order to graph the function, it's helpful to know the period. In order to determine the period, we first need to determine the scaling factor.\n\nNotice that the function $f(x) = \\tan \\left( \\dfrac{x}{4} \\right)$ can be written as $f(x) = \\tan \\left( \\dfrac{1}{4} x \\right).$ So, it takes the form $y=\\tan (Bx)$ with $B = \\dfrac{1}{4}.$\n\nThe horizontal scaling factor is given by\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{1}{B} = \\dfrac{1}{\\left( \\dfrac{1}{4} \\right)} = 4.\n$$\n\nSo, the period is\n\n$$\n\\pi \\cdot \\dfrac{1}{B} = \\pi \\cdot 4 = 4\\pi.\n$$\n\nNow that we know the period is $4\\pi,$ we can draw the general shape of the tangent function, but stretch it so that it fills up the interval $(-2\\pi, 2\\pi).$\n\nThe resulting graph is shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14254788/assets/43c8a5344a913ce05dd81887a1bfffc8ca0d8dd78a582fe66e4d7a2f83a90f5a.png)",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-12058\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"12058\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"3574\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-12058\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-9\">Identifying the Graph of a Stretched Tangent Function</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"12058\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n              